{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38877","headline":"投江上崔尚书 · 杜荀鹤","name":"投江上崔尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此生何路出尘埃，犹把中才谒上才。\n闭户十年专笔砚，仰天无处认梯媒。\n马前霜叶催归去，枕上边鸿唤觉来。\n若许登门换鬐鬣，必应辛苦事风雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}